high 2850 (bar 114).", "Bars 1-7 close 2006.31, 2006.06, 1859.02, 1813.04, 1731, 1581.32, 1568.55 (seven consecutive lower closes); bar 7 spans 1599.27-1368.42 and closes 1568.55, well above its low.", "Bars 8-44 stay inside 1512.91 (bar 27 low) and 1845.09 (bar 16 high); no close exceeds 1845.09, and lows after bar 27 rise (1551.6, 1560.05, 1597.72, 1694.74, 1751.07).", "Bars 45-58 print higher highs 1891.66, 1944.39, 1954.36, 1974.46 with pullbacks only to 1848.82/1850.53; bars 62-80 then hold a roughly 19-bar band above 1821.49 (bar 65 low).", "Bars 81-83 are three large bull trend bars closing 2252.16, 2326.32, 2515.3; bar 81 opens at the prior close 1916.51 and bar 83 reaches 2771.", "Bars 84-107 spend 24 bars inside 2357.18 (bar 95 low) and 2557.46 (bar 89 high); upside attempts fail to hold: bar 104 high 2680 closes 2514.72, bar 107 high 2609.02 closes 2514.07.", "Bar 108 prints 2358.62, slightly above the 2357.18 low (bar 95); bars 111-114 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, all above the 2557.46 range top.", "Bars 115-120 overlap between 2633.31 (bar 117 low) and 2786.81 (bar 116 high), closing 2752.43, 2684.16, 2686.59, 2690.56, 2694.96, 2685.9; no print above 2850 since bar 114.", "Last bar (120) 2694.96/2718.83/2668.55/2685.9 is a small-range, doji-like bar fully contained inside bar 116's 2752.43-2641.37 range."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: seven lower closes with the largest bear bar last (1599.27-1368.42, close 1568.55), leaving a long lower tail above the window low 1368.42 - a selling-climax shape at the bottom.", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780185600000, "upper_boundary": "2035.94"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range after the low: about 37 overlapping bars capped by 1845.09 (bar 16) and floored by 1512.91 (bar 27); later bars inside i